ts arm (from the victim's corpse or after the arm is removed) and reattaches it with an Interact action.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"mLvlZod278HKBbTc","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687208791406,"modifiedTime":1687208814497,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Gnaw","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The cadavalier has a creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} with its jaws.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The cadavalier gnaws and chews on the grabbed target with its jaws, dealing [[/r (2d6+6)[piercing]]] damage (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:22|basic:true] save). On a critical failure, the creature is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 1} from the pain.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"2VyIlZEQ3BE5pKBu","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","